sequence-diagram

title Catalyst Radar - From announcement to alert

Scheduler [icon: clock]
Watcher [icon: eye]
TinyFish [icon: cpu, color: orange]
Triage [icon: sliders]
Investigator [icon: search]
Verifier [icon: check-circle]
Analyst [icon: edit-3]
Claude [icon: message-square, color: orange]
DB [icon: database, color: blue]
WebApp [icon: react, color: blue]

Scheduler > Watcher: every 5 min (NSE)
Watcher > TinyFish: Agent run (stealth) - list today's announcements
TinyFish --> WebApp: streaming_url (live browser view)
TinyFish > Watcher: items JSON (output_schema)
Watcher > DB: save new items (skip if content_hash exists)

loop [label: each new item] {
  Watcher > Triage: item
  Triage > Claude: classify (Haiku)
  Claude > Triage: event_type, materiality
  alt [label: materiality >= 60] {
    Triage > Investigator: material event
    Investigator > TinyFish: open filing PDF, extract facts
    TinyFish > Investigator: facts JSON
    Investigator > Verifier: facts
    Verifier > TinyFish: Search + Fetch other sources
    TinyFish > Verifier: matching articles
    Verifier > Analyst: facts + verification + evidence
    Analyst > Claude: write alert (Sonnet, cite evidence ids)
    Claude > Analyst: alert JSON
    Analyst > Analyst: validate schema + citations
    Analyst > DB: save alert
    DB --> WebApp: SSE new alert
  }
  else [label: routine] {
    Triage > DB: mark as routine
  }
}
